# Build-context allowlist: local credentials, virtual environments and test
# artifacts are not sent to the builder, even if a COPY is later broadened.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!app/
!app/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/credentials*
**/secrets/
